    """
    Find the closest vowel that stands between two consonants from the right side of the word
    (case sensitive). Vowels in the beginning and ending don't count. Return empty string if no
    vowel is found.

    :param word: A string containing only English letters.
    :return: The closest vowel or an empty string if no vowel is found.
